# shell: desktop
# apps: fixture
# PVN-035: when an entry's type changes -- here by the rename that IS how
# a name-derived type changes -- the type-dependent menus are rebuilt: the
# Open With list follows the new type at the very next open.
wait 10
click-row 1 3
wait 3
menu-pick Open with
wait 3
expect-menu Stamper (opens this type)
key Escape
wait 3
note renamed to a .png, the same row's menu now offers the png handler.
note The view learns of the rename from the notice pump, which runs every
note 400 ms: the wait after the rename covers one pump with room to spare
click-row 1
wait 2
key e ctrl
wait 3
key a ctrl
key a
key .
key p
key n
key g
key Return
wait 30
click-row 1 3
wait 3
menu-pick Open with
wait 3
expect-menu Oddball (opens this type)
quit
